  "editorial": {
    "name": "Braid Design System",
    "descriptionZh": "SEEK Group 的设计系统文档站，以 React 组件加 CSS 变量主题实现，主题底层走 vanilla-extract。站里反复强调让设计师和开发者在 Playroom 里用同一套组件一起迭代，少做高保真稿。",
    "takeawayZh": "在 Playroom 里用 Braid 组件拼原型",
    "noteZh": "首页标题下第一句是 Welcome to Braid, the themeable design system for the SEEK Group.，接着解释 Braid 用一组 React 组件加 CSS variable-based styling themes（底层 vanilla-extract）来加快跨品牌 UI 开发。左栏分组很细：RESOURCES 段是 Releases / Gallery / Playroom / GitHub，GUIDES 段是 Design Workflow / Development Workflow / Playroom Prototyping / Contribution / Testing Guide，FOUNDATIONS 段是 Layout / Tones / Iconography，TEMPLATES 段的 Layouts 与 Sections 都挂着 New 标，再往下是 EXAMPLES 的 Job Summary / Basic Form / Marketing Banner 和一大串 COMPONENTS。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
